CM_ BO_ 769 "One object; sent once per object per scan. SLOT orders the frames within a scan.";
CM_ SG_ 769 DIST_X "Nearest face of the object, from the ego reference point (ISO 8855, forward).";
CM_ SG_ 769 DIST_Y "ISO 8855, positive left.";
CM_ SG_ 769 VEL_X "Over-ground velocity rotated into the ego frame.";
CM_ BO_ 785 "Corner radar objects: DIST_X is signed (rear radars see objects behind). The reported point is the object centre (the radar sees the nearest point of its box).";
CM_ BO_ 832 "Park sensors, front bumper, left corner to right corner. 10.23 m = no echo, 10.22 m = no data (sensor fault).";
CM_ BO_ 833 "Park sensors, rear bumper, left corner to right corner. 10.23 m = no echo, 10.22 m = no data (sensor fault).";
CM_ BO_ 849 "Lane lines as y = C0 + C1 x + C2 x^2 + C3 x^3 (ISO 8855, from the ego reference point); LINE_TYPE 1 dashed, 2 solid, 3 road edge. CAM_LANE_LEFT/RIGHT are the ego lane's lines, LEFT2/RIGHT2 the next ones out.";
CM_ BO_ 853 "Camera objects: CLASS 0 unknown, 1 car, 2 truck, 3 pedestrian. Vehicles by their near face, pedestrians by their centre.";
CM_ SG_ 848 SPEED_LIMIT "The last speed-limit sign read (km/h); 0 = none.";
